{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "52dce21be2612b939d4a5b0c1a5b7da53296f1714c84ff52b80dc17fe2f46a80", "ja": "イイことも、ワルいことも", "zh": "好事也好，坏事也罢", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "276f7f7f19274a0056d65ef0d5d8d5994328a78f42ec632ec468c95292ed6f24", "ja": "亜美、真美、やよい、3人でレッスンの日。\n律子がいないのをいいことに、悪巧みをする\n亜美と真美。真面目にやった方がいいと注意\nするやよいだが、二人はやる気はある様子。\nイタズラとレッスン、どっちもやる気満々！", "zh": "亚美、真美、弥生和3人一起训练的日子。\n趁律子不在，亚美和真美打算搞些恶作剧。弥生提醒她们还是认真训练比较好，但两人似乎确实很有干劲。\n恶作剧和训练，两边都干劲十足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b46b2e4efca27c1c95fe913d5feb4675ce4757068bfe7a5e6195e4313a937a17", "ja": "（公演に向けてレッスンが始まっている。メンバーは\nそれぞれ忙しく、なかなか予定が合わない）", "zh": "（面向公演的排练正在进行中。成员们各自都很忙，时间很难凑到一起。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7745b04b12ce6df2a08a74e92879c1d55da59fff6542d0cd8c59096bbd37342e", "ja": "（今日は亜美と真美、やよいの3人がレッスン中だ。\n後で様子を見に行ってみるか……）", "zh": "（今天亚美、真美和弥生这3个人正在练习。之后要不要去看看她们的情况呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "7cd8b0f7eb1e6b28513f4d30864aac28ce0d9ae32d878cde451fc764fe4c61c1", "ja": "んっふっふ～ん♪", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "7cd8b0f7eb1e6b28513f4d30864aac28ce0d9ae32d878cde451fc764fe4c61c1", "ja": "んっふっふ～ん♪", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "b09ae7486d5f4dbe4e93ebb8db551564ad4e8bbd32aeb0b74a5394214b7ff5d4", "ja": "？　ふたりとも笑ってどうしたの？", "zh": "咦？你们两个笑什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "80516990747b5b1cb9880a192cfac8eb8f2d473a4dcbc15488cacd341508ddc4", "ja": "やよいっち。昔のことわざにこういうのがあるのだよ。\n「鬼のいぬ間に電卓！」", "zh": "弥生亲。以前有句谚语是这么说的哦。\n“趁鬼不在，用计算器！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "c5095e49a3ad52ce0e79438c2cf1e3fdf9f0abce9fa27ce2e0d63e6eaec098b4", "ja": "え～、私の知ってるのとちょっと違うかも～。\nえっと、貯金箱の中身を数えること？", "zh": "诶～，好像和我知道的有点不一样～。\n那个，意思是要数存钱罐里的钱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "424d6a77d13dddbb68db82a6221c020ee8d5b4c19f3fffab0f7ff4e293dc0f56", "ja": "ノンノン！　今日は律っちゃんが仕事でいない……。\nつまり、誰も真美たちを止められないってこと！", "zh": "不对不对！今天律子姐因为工作不在……  \n也就是说，没人能阻止真美她们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "7e61b06c1bf8ebc1eab405e8288c9f76c832a6a74253e66027d2220c6ab5a290", "ja": "今日こそ出ちゃうかもね～？\n亜美たちのイタズラフルコースが！", "zh": "今天说不定真的要出场了哦～？\n我们俩的恶作剧全套餐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "9558024490e55fe8ca2fac36944881a83ea7fc72545dd5c3d707fe9d0cb35a14", "ja": "ええっ、ちょっと待ってよ、亜美真美！\nもうダンスの先生も来る時間だし、ダメだよ～！", "zh": "诶诶，等一下啦，亚美、真美！舞蹈老师也差不多该来了，不行啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "3057d926700eeb13dc1ef6f4dc2f19206c8439047320066d1ac438eb74fb5d75", "ja": "律子さんがいないときは、\n私がふたりのお姉さんだからねっ。メッ！", "zh": "律子小姐不在的时候，\n我就是你们两个的姐姐哦。不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "86224693faa5c3d3ac619152d040c5efb0e0ab4965d9bb3fa077364765d71625", "ja": "うあうあ、やよいっちがお姉ちゃんモードになったー！\nまあまあ、ちょっと落ち着いてよ～。", "zh": "哇哇，弥生进到姐姐模式啦——！\n好啦好啦，稍微冷静一下嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "c6a8f9d0181ca3a1afefc94ae31dd0c34f409306faf07c0a0c33b13ce6e59db6", "ja": "そうそう。\n真美たち、レッスンしないとは言ってないっしょ？", "zh": "对对。\n真美她们又没说不练习，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "2b5be214b3a6ed52220610875bc83144cef5ebd6124471b573d6f8413cbb2e5f", "ja": "えっ？　でも、イタズラするって今……。", "zh": "诶？可是，你们刚才不是说要恶作剧吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "a7b88fa96983dd99c179c4ac5c2859fec7321bca1bb2bf3f42bac0abeaf7d378", "ja": "亜美たち、今は超ヤル気に満ちてるから。\nレッスンもイタズラも、全力でやるってだけ♪", "zh": "因为亚美她们现在干劲十足嘛。\n无论是训练还是恶作剧，都要全力以赴♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "12aacc13d12e7a0729787d1514722897f77369e37e5887e5e97e80a45a80dbee", "ja": "ターゲットは兄ちゃん、ただひとーり！\n全力でぶつかっていくよーっ！！", "zh": "目标只有哥哥一个人！\n我们要全力冲上去啦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "a5b2db8ac5fb9c75ffc59525af6928007028c236f1a7a5bc58c94da5bc758a54", "ja": "そうなんだ？　それならいいのかな……。\nうう、やっぱりよくないんじゃ……？", "zh": "这样啊？那应该没问题吧……  \n呜呜，果然还是不太好吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "1eeb383c21b3c9a84258e191caf103d7bd338fac6d664ce64a5de379e70dc4a7", "ja": "それよりほら、ダンスのセンセーが来る前に、\nストレッチやっとこうよ！", "zh": "比起那个，来嘛，在舞蹈老师来之前，先做做拉伸吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "d5aff202194e5f184bdec8d78f46e27423f8714f86f4a829089d5f794472161a", "ja": "ペアになって、背中伸ばすヤツやろー！", "zh": "两人一组，做那个伸展背部的动作吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "f86ddbd39c2316fac69e63b463243ca6588a266aab40f6db2cc86269367b6cdd", "ja": "え……、あ、うん！\n本当に、やる気はあるんだ……！", "zh": "诶……啊，嗯！\n我真的……是有干劲的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1020_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "81e0cf7455eb17654ec83c1c58ec571c1967e2b534f9297e0209e5356d68b123", "ja": "ふぃ～、終わった終わった～。\nなんか今日のセンセー、いつもより厳しかったね。", "zh": "呼——结束了结束了～  \n感觉今天老师比平时更严格呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "083ca829336d308b31ad91e9f1d73aa014b3cb6b8c137da31c2d488aeae12444", "ja": "3人とも、レッスンお疲れ様！", "zh": "你们3个，课程辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1023_005yay", "source_sha256": "81c7da749a2a354b773af0ed4ffcdadc712d7aa312b6015e5eaeeac6365825cb", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nお疲れさまですー！　もうお仕事いいんですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n辛苦啦——！已经忙完了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "09ef201aee8b3a2b4d458e12fa612dfa22b76999147c4805af5ae7df97b95c25", "ja": "ああ、一段落したところだよ。ところで今、\n廊下でトレーナーさんと会ったんだけど……", "zh": "啊，刚忙完一阵。对了，刚才我在走廊遇到了训练师……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "661400b1565724f42ccf405427355e7ff45fc3cd7d9800e3182ba1ad400bda02", "ja": "3人のこと、すごく褒めてたぞ！\n本番が楽しみだって。やったな！", "zh": "她非常夸奖你们3个人呢！\n说很期待正式演出的表现。太棒啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "103b1295feb0ef3c4eacba093a6601edbf70eab2899d1e9833963b2526e32737", "ja": "えーっ、直接言ってくれたらいいのに～。\nセンセーも恥ずかしがり屋さんだねっ。", "zh": "诶——直接跟我们说就好了嘛～。\n老师也是个害羞的人呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1027_012mam", "source_sha256": "59c6e45d596a7cbc75f9a42e7facd0043c6ebb7631bcc24068edcb3a054692bb", "ja": "兄ちゃん、よかったね！　自慢の真美たちが褒められて\n鼻の下伸びたっしょ？", "zh": "哥哥，太好了！你引以为傲的真美她们被夸奖了，开心得都合不拢嘴了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1028_p", "source_sha256": "796e824d8aaf9531c6a9218617778eab52c8e051db341b36283bc779b62df6f5", "ja": "そうだな、鼻が高かったよ。伸びてないけど。", "zh": "是啊，真是让我觉得脸上有光。不过鼻子可没变长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1029_005yay", "source_sha256": "6464097b712acdf7dd437e548782aa443df7b46b3ee47682a2dc5486a28d72e3", "ja": "うっうー！　私も嬉しいかもです～。\n次はもっともっと頑張れそうかなーって♪", "zh": "呜呼——！我也好开心呀～。\n感觉下次能更加更加努力了呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1030_011ami", "source_sha256": "7d7e3074623086571dd66992e4e27498f95b1e9eebcc2da72d5224a1c8aef4a0", "ja": "兄ちゃん。昔のことわざに、こういうのがあるのだよ。\n「アメはムチムチ！」", "zh": "哥哥。古时候有句谚语，是这么说的哦。\n“糖果就是肉嘟嘟！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "5f2e4bd8bd43693869100c71cc8b5ce2c31b733016051d510a863b5406dbe601", "ja": "ことわざかな、それ……。\nつまり、何が言いたいんだ？", "zh": "那算是谚语吗……\n你到底想说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1032_011ami", "source_sha256": "2563a168d9b60a5d36b0f1915448c27de62c5b2f23f6c7580d5c15c70f0f7f0a", "ja": "だからー、\nそろそろアメをくれてもいいよ、ってこと！", "zh": "所以说——\n差不多也该给我糖了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1033_012mam", "source_sha256": "c0287a6b6119cabac9f8206f0002b23cf8c5669fed8239658996df55f1cae16c", "ja": "そうそう、頑張り過ぎてお腹がヘリコプターだよ～。\n何かおやつ、買って買って～！", "zh": "对对，努力过头，肚子都变成直升机啦～。\n买点零食嘛，买嘛买嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1034_005yay", "source_sha256": "5f0524b66b47d8d91f051837e4ce35f072b5e646f0a98e712fcd9252a0e3a0d9", "ja": "もう、亜美、真美？\nあんまり{$P$}を困らせちゃダメ！", "zh": "真是的，亚美、真美？\n别太让{$P$}先生为难了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1035_p", "source_sha256": "177dc5696a6ab5e559d0d7709892119f42009fd4ffb6f12a72dcd88cc7a1485b", "ja": "いや、まあいいよ。本当に頑張ってくれてるし。\nやよいも、欲しいものを教えてくれ。", "zh": "不，没关系。她们真的很努力。\n弥生也告诉我你想要什么吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_03_1036_011ami", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
